WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.357 --> 00:00:15.063
The animals tried to stop Mowgli.

2
00:00:15.064 --> 00:00:21.315
But he was already racing toward the village.

3
00:00:21.315 --> 00:00:25.847
By twilight he reached the grazing grounds.

4
00:00:25.847 --> 00:00:28.848
Fear jumped up in his throat.

5
00:00:28.848 --> 00:00:31.930
Everyone was in from the fields early.

6
00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:36.481
Instead of preparing dinner, people were gathered under the fig tree.

7
00:00:36.481 --> 00:00:42.386
They were shouting angrily.

8
00:00:42.386 --> 00:00:46.168
Mowgli crept to Messua’s hut.

9
00:00:46.169 --> 00:00:51.047
Peeking through a window, he saw Messua's husband tied to the bed.

10
00:00:51.047 --> 00:00:55.460
Messua lay on the floor, bound and gagged.

11
00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:59.886
She was breathing hard and groaning in pain.

12
00:00:59.886 --> 00:01:04.724
Mowgli gasped. Messua had been badly beaten!

13
00:01:04.725 --> 00:01:08.087
Mowgli knew the habits of the villagers well.

14
00:01:08.088 --> 00:01:13.290
As long as the people could eat and talk, they would stay under the tree.

15
00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:19.394
But they would come when Buldeo returned to the village—without Mowgli.

16
00:01:19.394 --> 00:01:23.281
He slipped through the window of the hut.

17
00:01:23.281 --> 00:01:28.179
Bending over Messua and her husband, he cut their ties.

18
00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:32.073
Messua looked like she was in terrible pain.

19
00:01:32.073 --> 00:01:38.715
Mowgli put his hand over her mouth to stop her from screaming.

20
00:01:38.715 --> 00:01:42.607
"I knew you would come," Messua sobbed.

21
00:01:42.607 --> 00:01:45.452
"I knew you were my son!"

22
00:01:45.452 --> 00:01:50.563
"Who did this to you?" Mowgli demanded.

23
00:01:50.563 --> 00:01:54.204
"The whole village," Messua's husband answered.

24
00:01:54.204 --> 00:01:58.585
"They think we are rich sorcerers who are using magic."

25
00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:02.527
Mowgli was confused by all the talk about magic.

26
00:02:02.527 --> 00:02:06.167
"What is a sorcerer exactly?"

27
00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:09.447
"See!" Messua said to her husband.

28
00:02:09.447 --> 00:02:14.059
"He's no sorcerer. He's my son!"

29
00:02:14.059 --> 00:02:18.582
"Son or sorcerer, what does it matter?" the man answered.

30
00:02:18.582 --> 00:02:20.890
"We're going to die."

31
00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:26.746
Mowgli pointed through the window. "You're free now. Go."

32
00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:31.108
“Go where?" Messua's eyes were wide and frightened.

33
00:02:31.108 --> 00:02:33.458
"We don't know the jungle well.

34
00:02:33.458 --> 00:02:37.970
And I'm injured. I can't walk very fast."

35
00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:45.191
"The villagers will follow us," her husband added. "It's hopeless."

36
00:02:45.191 --> 00:02:50.031
From outside, Mowgli heard shouting and trampling.

37
00:02:50.032 --> 00:02:52.887
"It sounds like Buldeo has returned.

38
00:02:52.888 --> 00:02:56.641
Think about where you will go. I'll be right back."

39
00:02:56.641 --> 00:03:03.111
He bounded through the window and crept back to the tree.

40
00:03:03.111 --> 00:03:07.085
Buldeo lay on the ground, coughing and groaning.

41
00:03:07.085 --> 00:03:10.760
The crowd was yelling out questions.

42
00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:13.312
"Did you kill the boy?"

43
00:03:13.312 --> 00:03:17.145
"Did he use magic again?"

44
00:03:17.145 --> 00:03:21.205
Buldeo mumbled something and then called for water.

45
00:03:21.205 --> 00:03:27.205
"First a drink. Then I'll tell you my story."

46
00:03:27.205 --> 00:03:30.637
"Bah!" Mowgli said to himself.

47
00:03:30.637 --> 00:03:36.419
"All humans do is talk. They'll be under the tree forever!"

48
00:03:36.419 --> 00:03:41.053
Mowgli returned to the hut.

49
00:03:41.053 --> 00:03:46.537
Just as he reached the window, he felt a soft touch on his foot.

50
00:03:46.537 --> 00:03:49.330
"Mother Wolf!"

51
00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.262
"I followed you into the village, Mowgli.

52
00:03:52.262 --> 00:03:55.884
I wanted to see the woman who took care of you."

53
00:03:55.884 --> 00:04:00.159
"The villagers plan to kill her!" Mowgli quickly explained.

54
00:04:00.159 --> 00:04:04.239
"Messua must escape through the jungle."

55
00:04:04.239 --> 00:04:08.485
"I will protect her," Mother said.

56
00:04:08.485 --> 00:04:16.970
She slipped back into the darkness to await Mowgli's instructions.

57
00:04:16.971 --> 00:04:21.390
Messua and her husband had decided to go to the next village.

58
00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:26.161
It would take hours to get there.

59
00:04:26.161 --> 00:04:29.311
Mowgli helped them through the window.

60
00:04:29.311 --> 00:04:34.815
In the starlight the jungle looked dark and dangerous.

61
00:04:34.815 --> 00:04:38.125
"Do you know the way?" he whispered.

62
00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:40.142
The couple nodded.

63
00:04:40.142 --> 00:04:46.709
"Good. Don't be afraid. I promise—the jungle will protect you.

64
00:04:46.709 --> 00:04:52.183
Go now and travel slowly. There's no need to hurry."

65
00:04:52.183 --> 00:04:59.838
Tears streaming down her cheeks, Messua hugged Mowgli good-bye.

66
00:04:59.838 --> 00:05:07.011
Then they headed into the dark jungle.

67
00:05:07.011 --> 00:05:11.611
Mother Wolf silently followed.

68
00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:14.209
Soon someone else appeared.

69
00:05:14.209 --> 00:05:18.777
"Bagheera!" Mowgli quickly explained the situation.

70
00:05:18.777 --> 00:05:23.186
"Buldeo is still telling stories to the villagers.

71
00:05:23.186 --> 00:05:28.834
However, he will stop talking, and then the people will come.

72
00:05:28.834 --> 00:05:33.758
What will we do when the humans find this trap empty?"

73
00:05:33.758 --> 00:05:37.314
"Hmm." Bagheera thought for a moment.

74
00:05:37.314 --> 00:05:40.763
"I have an idea."
